# Seam Root — policy shell, covers-target/emit-entry (no `code is` of its own).
library "Seam Root".

/* INCLUDES Seam Included (→ primary seed → bare domain) and references Seam Sibling
   by qualified ref (→ cross-lib sibling → disambiguated domain). Declares NO `code is`
   itself, so nothing collides with the bare Seam Included. One fixture, both cells. */

include "Seam Included".

decision "Seam Coverage":
first:
- when "Seam Included"."Included Finding" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- when "Seam Sibling"."Sibling Finding" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage criteria met.`.

activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage criteria not met.`.
